  "id": "28/G",
  "goal": "Explain how human visual and spatial perception constrain the optics and display requirements of three-dimensional XR systems.",
  "achieves": "Gives the learner the human-factors foundation for evaluating and optimizing the visual hardware and user experience of an XR system."
